.TH TIMER_TICK 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
timer_tick \- Advance a timer by dt
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "bool timer_tick(Timer *t, float dt);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Advance a timer by dt. Returns true on the single tick it reaches zero, then stops.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR timer_start (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
